<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The last remaining application to be updated to support PHP 8.3 is the <a href="https://github.com/dotkernel/api" data-type="link" data-id="https://github.com/dotkernel/api" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">API</a>, now at v4.2.1. The steps taken to perform the update are similar to the ones in the update for the <a href="https://github.com/dotkernel/frontend" data-type="link" data-id="https://github.com/dotkernel/frontend" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Frontend</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The full list of file changes is <a href="https://github.com/dotkernel/api/pull/222" data-type="link" data-id="https://github.com/dotkernel/admin/pull/218/files" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">here</a>.</p>
